From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opencode-port <port@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:31:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] D401 cli: session list leaves out archived sessions

Upstream: `opencode session list` lists archived sessions, so sessions created with `run --archived` (whose flag says it keeps them "out of session lists") still appear; the TUI session lists and `run --continue` already exclude them.
Fixed: `session list` asks the server for unarchived sessions only (`archived: false`).
Scenarios: cli-run.test.ts "run sets the title and archives"
Upstream tests: none changed

diff --git a/packages/cli/src/commands/handlers/session/list.ts b/packages/cli/src/commands/handlers/session/list.ts
index b3a1bbbb58..db72e1e7ae 100644
--- a/packages/cli/src/commands/handlers/session/list.ts
+++ b/packages/cli/src/commands/handlers/session/list.ts
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@ const handler = Effect.fn("cli.session.list")(function* (
         {
           project: location.project.id,
           parentID: null,
+          archived: false,
           order: "desc",
           limit: Option.getOrElse(input.maxCount, () => 100),
         },
